ify with  their  countries of origin they'll do that on  their own  very happily if they feel like it so and  because uh the new leader andrew shearer  is has come out strongly in favor this  sense of canadian identity let people  join the mainstream as opposed to what  justin trudeau and his liberals are  doing then i support the conservatives  let's not run these horrendous deficits  let's not promote the idea that there is  no canadian identity  uh  and so to that extent i support the  conservatives but i do not buy into any  of this sort of conservatism that seems  to be  uh you know front and center with the  republican party of the united states i  don't even understand it i don't know  where those people are coming from  and i think to that extent i'm quite  representative of people who of a  majority of people who would vote for  the conservatives here in canada  anyway there you have it a little bit  about politicians and language i hope  andrew scheer improves his french and we  would love to help him out here at link  so if anybody knows andrew scheer tell  him that i'm happy to help him out i  would like him to be fluent in french so  that he can win the next election  thank you for listening bye for now  [Music]  you
 

